	(lib_symbols)
	(text "CrossCheck - ankle-worn leg-crossing / leg-bouncing wearable (CS 437 FA26)\n\nNode A (emitter ankle): Feather ESP32-S3, 9DoF IMU,\n  940 nm IR LED with 3 drive levels, magnet, vibration motor.\nNode B (receiver ankle): Feather ESP32-S3, 9DoF IMU (magnetometer),\n  TSSP77038 + TSOP38238 IR receivers, DRV5032 hall switch, vibration motor.\nNodes talk over ESP-NOW - there are no wires between them.\n\nPin map            Node A              Node B\n  D5               IMU INT1            IMU INT1\n  D6               -                   hall switch\n  D9               IR drive LO         TSSP77038 out\n  D10              IR drive MID        TSOP38238 out\n  D11              IR drive HI         -\n  D12              motor driver        motor driver\n\nBreadboard / proof-of-concept wiring only. Net labels with the\nsame name on a sheet are connected."
